# Motorcomm YT8512 Ethernet PHY

config PHY_MOTORCOMM_YT8512
	bool "Motorcomm YT8512 Ethernet PHY driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_MOTORCOMM_YT8512_ENABLED
	depends on ETH_STM32_HAL
	select MDIO
	help
	  Motorcomm YT8512/YT8512C 10/100 Ethernet PHY driver, ported from
	  the upstream phy_motorcomm_yt8521.c (same MII register layout,
	  specific status register 0x11).

	  The PHY ID check accepts MII register 0x03 Type_No 0x12 (YT8512
	  family); the YT8521-specific extended registers (0xA000 space
	  select / RGMII delay / SYNCE) are not touched. reset-gpios is
	  supported (the Apollo V2 board routes PHY reset through a PCF8574
	  I2C IO expander).

	  Depends on ETH_STM32_HAL: 无网络配置的应用 (MDIO 控制器不编译)
	  不应拉入本驱动, 否则链接失败 (mdio 设备符号未定义)。
